---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ArrowLink from '../../components/ArrowLink.astro';
import HandNote from '../../components/HandNote.astro';
import RiderTry from '../../components/projects/RiderTry.astro';
import HealthcareGuess from '../../components/projects/HealthcareGuess.astro';
import PreTickTry from '../../components/projects/PreTickTry.astro';
import DriftSketch from '../../components/visuals/DriftSketch.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects" description="Things Moksha built, tested, or investigated because the question interested her.">
  <section class="container grid proj-hero">
    <div class="ph-main">
      <h1 class="t-page">Projects</h1>
      <p class="lede ph-sub">Things I built, tested, or investigated because the question interested me.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ph-aside hide-sm">
      <HandNote rotate={-3}>Different questions. Different tools. Same curiosity.</HandNote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container projects">
    <!-- 01 -->
    <article class="project grid" aria-labelledby="p1-title">
      <div class="p-text reveal">
        <p class="num p-n">01</p>
        <h2 class="t-section p-title" id="p1-title">Is the Algorithm Being Fair to Riders?</h2>
        <p class="p-q">Can a score tell a slow rider from a slow road?</p>
        <div class="p-copy">
          <p>Delivery riders are ranked by a single performance score. That score sees how long a delivery took. It doesn’t see the traffic jam or the rain.</p>
          <p>I reverse-engineered the scoring across <strong>15,000 deliveries</strong> to measure how much traffic, weather and experience were shaping it. Then I built a <strong>Fair Score</strong> that adjusts for conditions, so riders are judged on what they can actually control.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="p-key">A rider who works the hardest shifts shouldn’t rank lower for it.</p>
        <ul class="tags" role="list">
          <li class="tag tag--metric">15,000 deliveries</li>
          <li class="tag tag--metric">Fair Score</li>
          <li class="tag">Python</li>
          <li class="tag">Regression</li>
        </ul>
        <ArrowLink href="/projects/rider-fairness/" variant="button" class="p-cta">View project</ArrowLink>
      </div>
      <div class="p-visual reveal" style="--delay:120ms">
        <RiderTry />
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 02 -->
    <article class="project grid" aria-labelledby="p2-title">
      <div class="p-text reveal">
        <p class="num p-n">02</p>
        <h2 class="t-section p-title" id="p2-title">Healthcare Expenditure:<br /> A Gender-Based Analysis</h2>
        <p class="p-q">What actually drives what people spend on healthcare?</p>
        <div class="p-copy">
          <p>Healthcare spending isn’t only about how unwell someone is. Income, insurance, age and education all play a part, and they don’t always affect men and women the same way.</p>
          <p>For my undergraduate research, I surveyed <strong>210 people</strong> and used the Andersen model and multiple regression to test which factors mattered most, and whether they differed by gender. The model explained <strong>63.1%</strong> of the variation in spending.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="p-key">Women in the survey spent more on healthcare while reporting fewer financial resources to pay for it.</p>
        <ul class="tags" role="list">
          <li class="tag tag--metric">210 responses</li>
          <li class="tag tag--metric">R² 0.631</li>
          <li class="tag">Jamovi</li>
          <li class="tag">Regression</li>
        </ul>
        <ArrowLink href="/projects/healthcare-expenditure/" variant="button" class="p-cta">View project</ArrowLink>
        {site.healthcareReport && <ArrowLink href={site.healthcareReport} dir="ext" external class="p-report">View research report</ArrowLink>}
      </div>
      <div class="p-visual reveal" style="--delay:120ms">
        <HealthcareGuess />
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 03 -->
    <article class="project grid" aria-labelledby="p3-title">
      <div class="p-text reveal">
        <p class="num p-n">03</p>
        <h2 class="t-section p-title" id="p3-title">Tiny UX Decisions</h2>
        <p class="p-q">How much can one tiny interface change affect a decision?</p>
        <div class="p-copy">
          <p>Five interactive tests. In each one you make the same choice twice, and one small thing changes in between: a badge, a pre-ticked box, a stock warning, a longer cancellation flow, or a recommendation label.</p>
          <p>Then you try to spot the change, see how your answer moved, and read what the research and India’s 2023 dark-pattern rules say about it.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="p-key">The same click can mean several different things.</p>
        <ul class="tags" role="list">
          <li class="tag tag--metric">5 tests</li>
          <li class="tag">Behavioural design</li>
          <li class="tag">Experimentation</li>
          <li class="tag">React</li>
        </ul>
        {site.tinyUx && <ArrowLink href={site.tinyUx} external dir="ext" variant="button" class="p-cta">Try the experiments</ArrowLink>}
      </div>
      <div class="p-visual reveal" style="--delay:120ms">
        <PreTickTry />
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <!-- SMALLER EXPERIMENTS -->
  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="small-title">
    <h2 class="t-h3 small-title" id="small-title">Smaller experiments <span aria-hidden="true" class="small-arrow">→</span></h2>
    <div class="exp grid">
      <div class="exp-visual">
        {site.randomDrift
          ? <a href={site.randomDrift} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="exp-play" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><DriftSketch /></a>
          : <DriftSketch />}
      </div>
      <div class="exp-text">
        <h3 class="exp-name">Random Drift</h3>
        <p class="exp-copy">A small game I built while experimenting with movement, randomness, and browser interactions.</p>
        <ul class="tags" role="list">
          <li class="tag">Small build</li>
          <li class="tag">Web experiment</li>
        </ul>
        {site.randomDrift
          ? <ArrowLink href={site.randomDrift} variant="button" external class="exp-cta">Play the game</ArrowLink>
          : <p class="hand hand--grey exp-soon">link coming soon</p>}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .proj-hero { padding-top: clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px); align-items: end; }
  .ph-main { grid-column: 1 / span 8; }
  .ph-sub { margin-top: 24px; }
  .ph-aside { grid-column: 10 / span 3; padding-bottom: 10px; }
  .ph-aside :global(.hand-note) { max-width: 16ch; }

  .projects { padding-top: var(--space-section); display: grid; gap: var(--space-section); }
  .project { align-items: center; row-gap: 36px; }
  .p-text { grid-column: 1 / span 5; }
  .p-visual { grid-column: 7 / span 6; }
  .p-n { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .p-title { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 1.3rem + 1.8vw, 2.9rem); }
  .p-copy { margin: -6px 0 16px; max-width: 46ch; color: var(--grey); }
  .p-copy p + p { margin-top: 0.6em; }
  .p-copy strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .p-key { margin: 0 0 18px; font-weight: 500; }
  .p-q { margin: 18px 0 22px; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 500; color: var(--cobalt); max-width: 30ch; }
  :global(.p-cta) { margin-top: 28px; }
  :global(.p-report) { margin: 28px 0 0 20px; }

  .small-title { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .small-arrow { color: var(--cobalt); }
  .exp { align-items: center; row-gap: 24px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .exp-visual { grid-column: 1 / span 4; }
  .exp-text { grid-column: 6 / span 6; }
  .exp-name { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .exp-copy { margin: 10px 0 16px; max-width: 48ch; color: var(--grey); }
  :global(.exp-cta) { margin-top: 18px; }
  .exp-play { display: block; border-radius: 8px; transition: transform var(--t-micro) var(--ease); }
  .exp-play:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .exp-soon { margin-top: 14px; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .p-text, .p-visual, .ph-main { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .p-visual { max-width: 640px; }
    .ph-aside { display: none; }
    .exp-visual { grid-column: 1 / span 3; }
    .exp-text { grid-column: 4 / span 5; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .exp-visual, .exp-text { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }
</style>
